        "title": "Priority Task - To-Do",
        "description": "Priority Task - To-Do is a simple and flexible task manager designed to help you organize your daily work by priority, track progress clearly, and stay focused on what matters most.\n\nInstead of managing every task the same way, Priority Task lets you create different types of tasks depending on your goal. You can use simple checklists, track completion by percentage, or count progress toward a specific target.\n\nWhether you are planning daily work, building routines, tracking personal goals, or managing repeated tasks, Priority Task gives you a clean and practical way to stay organized.\n\nKey Features\n\n• Priority-based task management\nCreate tasks and organize them by priority: High, Medium, or Low. This helps you quickly see what needs your attention first.\n\n• Multiple task types\nChoose the task style that fits your goal:\n• Binary tasks: simple to-do tasks with done or not done status.\n• Percentage tasks: track progress from 0% to 100%.\n• Count tasks: set a target number and update your progress step by step.\n\n• Recurring tasks\nCreate tasks that repeat on selected days of the week. This is useful for routines, habits, weekly plans, and repeated responsibilities.\n\n• To-do and Done tabs\nKeep your active tasks and completed tasks separated, so your workspace stays clear and easy to follow.\n\n• Task details and notes\nAdd titles, notes, priority levels, task types, and progress information to make each task easier to manage.\n\n• History tracking\nReview past tasks and check what you have completed over time.\n\n• Statistics and progress overview\nView useful statistics and charts to better understand your productivity and task completion progress.\n\n• Account support\nSign in with your account or use Google Sign-In to manage your tasks more conveniently.\n\n• Multi-language support\nUse the app in your preferred language for a more comfortable experience.\n\nWhy choose Priority Task - To-Do?\n\nPriority Task is built for users who want more than a basic checklist. It helps you decide what is important, track how much progress you have made, and manage repeated tasks without making the app complicated.\n\nStay organized, focus on your priorities, and complete your tasks with more clarity every day.",
        "descriptionHTML": "Priority Task - To-Do is a simple and flexible task manager designed to help you organize your daily work by priority, track progress clearly, and stay focused on what matters most.<br><br>Instead of managing every task the same way, Priority Task lets you create different types of tasks depending on your goal. You can use simple checklists, track completion by percentage, or count progress toward a specific target.<br><br>Whether you are planning daily work, building routines, tracking personal goals, or managing repeated tasks, Priority Task gives you a clean and practical way to stay organized.<br><br>Key Features<br><br>• Priority-based task management<br>Create tasks and organize them by priority: High, Medium, or Low. This helps you quickly see what needs your attention first.<br><br>• Multiple task types<br>Choose the task style that fits your goal:<br>• Binary tasks: simple to-do tasks with done or not done status.<br>• Percentage tasks: track progress from 0% to 100%.<br>• Count tasks: set a target number and update your progress step by step.<br><br>• Recurring tasks<br>Create tasks that repeat on selected days of the week. This is useful for routines, habits, weekly plans, and repeated responsibilities.<br><br>• To-do and Done tabs<br>Keep your active tasks and completed tasks separated, so your workspace stays clear and easy to follow.<br><br>• Task details and notes<br>Add titles, notes, priority levels, task types, and progress information to make each task easier to manage.<br><br>• History tracking<br>Review past tasks and check what you have completed over time.<br><br>• Statistics and progress overview<br>View useful statistics and charts to better understand your productivity and task completion progress.<br><br>• Account support<br>Sign in with your account or use Google Sign-In to manage your tasks more conveniently.<br><br>• Multi-language support<br>Use the app in your preferred language for a more comfortable experience.<br><br>Why choose Priority Task - To-Do?<br><br>Priority Task is built for users who want more than a basic checklist. It helps you decide what is important, track how much progress you have made, and manage repeated tasks without making the app complicated.<br><br>Stay organized, focus on your priorities, and complete your tasks with more clarity every day.",
